---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Delete 10Botics Tutor Account | 刪除導師應用程式帳戶"
  description="How a 10Botics tutor can request deletion of their app account and associated data."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Delete your 10Botics Tutor account</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">刪除你的 10Botics Tutor 帳戶</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mt-10">
      <p>
        10Botics Tutor is a business application for tutors and other service providers providing
        services through 10Botics Ltd. You may request deletion of your app account and associated
        personal data at any time.
      </p>
      <p>
        10Botics Tutor 是供與 10Botics Ltd 合作的導師及其他服務供應者使用的業務應用程式。
        你可隨時要求刪除應用程式帳戶及相關個人資料。
      </p>

      <h2>How to request deletion / 如何提出刪除要求</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:info@10botics.com?subject=10Botics%20Tutor%20account%20deletion%20request">info@10botics.com</a>
        from the Google email address used to sign in. Use the subject “10Botics Tutor account
        deletion request” and include your full name. We may ask you to verify your identity
        before processing the request.
      </p>
      <p>
        請使用登入應用程式的 Google 電郵地址，電郵至
        <a href="mailto:info@10botics.com?subject=10Botics%20Tutor%20account%20deletion%20request">info@10botics.com</a>，
        主旨填寫「10Botics Tutor account deletion request」，並提供你的全名。
        我們在處理要求前可能會要求你核實身份。
      </p>

      <h2>Data deleted / 將會刪除的資料</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your app account will be disabled and you will no longer be able to sign in or access lessons and opportunities.／你的應用程式帳戶將被停用，並不能再登入或存取課堂及教學機會。</li>
        <li>Profile and contact details, residential address, identity and eligibility documents, recent photograph, emergency-contact information, notification tokens and other account data that are no longer required will be deleted or anonymised.／不再需要的個人及聯絡資料、住址、身份及資格證明文件、近照、緊急聯絡人資料、通知識別碼及其他帳戶資料將被刪除或匿名化。</li>
        <li>Pending applications may be withdrawn or cancelled where appropriate.／尚未處理的申請可能會按情況被撤回或取消。</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data that may be retained / 可能保留的資料</h2>
      <p>
        Deletion does not cancel obligations, payments, agreements or assignments already
        incurred. Agreement, payment, accounting, tax, lesson, attendance, safeguarding,
        dispute, security and audit records may be retained where reasonably required for
        contractual, legal or regulatory purposes. These records are generally retained for
        no longer than seven years after the relevant transaction or relationship ends, unless
        a longer period is required by law, legal proceedings or an active dispute. Retained
        records will not be used to provide continued app access.
      </p>
      <p>
        刪除帳戶不會取消已產生的責任、付款、協議或課堂安排。如因合約、法律或監管用途而
        合理需要，本公司可能保留協議、付款、會計、稅務、課堂、出席、保障、爭議、安全及
        審計紀錄。除非法律、法律程序或尚未解決的爭議要求更長的保留期，這些紀錄一般不會在
        有關交易或合作關係結束後保留超過七年。保留的紀錄不會用於繼續提供應用程式存取權。
      </p>

      <p>
        For information about personal data, retention and your access or correction rights,
        read the <a href="/tutor-app/privacy">10Botics Tutor Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        有關個人資料、保留安排及查閱或更正權利，請參閱
        <a href="/tutor-app/privacy">10Botics Tutor 私隱政策</a>。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
